</div></div></div></div></li><li role="menuitem" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="true" tabIndex="0" aria-label="Information for" id="menu-item-main1-1" class="dropdown menu-parent"><button type="button" id="main1-2" data-id="global-header-info-menu" data-toggle="dropdown" aria-controls="main1-dropdown-2" aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false" tabIndex="-1" class="dropdown-toggle"><span>Information for</span><i aria-hidden="true" class="icon-arrow_down pull-right"></i></button><ul id="main1-dropdown-2" class="dropdown-menu"><li><a href="https://www.sagepub.com/journals/information-for-authors/overview" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-id="global-header-authors-link" class="dropdown-item menu-item"><span>Authors</span>&nbsp;<i aria-hidden="true" class="icon-download-sitation"></i></a></li><li><a href="https://www.sagepub.com/journals/information-for-editors/overview" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-id="global-header-editors-link" class="dropdown-item menu-item"><span>Editors</span>&nbsp;<i aria-hidden="true" class="icon-download-sitation"></i></a></li><li><a href="https://www.sagepub.com/journals/information-for-librarians/overview" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-id="global-header-librarians-link" class="dropdown-item menu-item"><span>Librarians</span>&nbsp;<i aria-hidden="true" class="icon-download-sitation"></i></a></li><li><a href="https://journalssolutions.sagepub.com/search?entity=articles&amp;faqlist=162&amp;text=" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-id="global-header-researchers-link" class="dropdown-item menu-item"><span>Researchers</span>&nbsp;<i aria-hidden="true" class="icon-download-sitation"></i></a></li><li><a href="https://www.sagepub.com/journals/information-for-reviewers/overview" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-id="global-header-reviewers-link" class="dropdown-item menu-item"><span>Reviewers</span>&nbsp;<i aria-hidden="true" class="icon-download-sitation"></i></a></li><li><a href="https://www.sagepub.com/journals/information-