 BM, van Rossum EFC. Hair cortisol, stress exposure, and mental health in humans: A systematic review. <em>Psychoneuroendocrinology</em>. 2013; 38(8), 1220–1235.</div><div class="external-links"><div class="core-xlink-crossref"><a href="https://doi.org/10.1016/j.psyneuen.2012.11.015">Crossref</a></div><div class="core-xlink-pubmed"><a href="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/23253896/">PubMed</a></div><div class="core-xlink-isi"><a href="https://gateway.webofknowledge.com/gateway/Gateway.cgi?GWVersion=2&amp;DestApp=WOS_CPL&amp;UsrCustomerID=5e3815c904498985e796fc91436abd9a&amp;SrcAuth=atyponcel&amp;SrcApp=literatum&amp;DestLinkType=FullRecord&amp;KeyUT=WOS%3A000321234000002">Web of Science</a></div><div class="core-xlink-google-scholar"><a href="https://scholar.google.com/scholar_lookup?title=Hair+cortisol%2C+stress+exposure%2C+and+mental+health+in+humans%3A+A+systematic+review&amp;author=SM+Staufenbiel&amp;author=BWJH+Penninx&amp;author=AT+Spijker&amp;author=BM+Elzinga&amp;author=EFC+van+Rossum&amp;publication_year=2013&amp;journal=Psychoneuroendocrinology&amp;pages=1220-1235&amp;doi=10.1016%2Fj.psyneuen.2012.11.015&amp;pmid=23253896">Google Scholar</a></div></div></div></div></div><div role="listitem"><div id="bibr5-2156587216668109" class="citations"><div class="citation"><div class="citation-content"><span class="label">5.</span> Thoits PA. Stress and Health: Major Findings and Policy Implications. <em>J Health Soc Behav</em>. 2010; 51: S41–S53.</div><div class="external-links"><div class="core-xlink-crossref"><a href="/servlet/linkout?suffix=e_1_3_3_6_2&amp;dbid=4&amp;doi=10.1177%2F2156587216668109&amp;key=10.1177%2F0022146510383499&amp;site=sage">Crossref</a></div><div class="core-xlink-pubmed"><a href="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/20943582/">PubMed</a></div><div class="core-xlink-isi"><a href="https://gateway.webofknowledge.com/gateway/Gateway.cgi?GWVersion=2&amp;DestApp=WOS_CPL&amp;UsrCustomerID=5e3815c904498985e796fc91436abd9a&amp;SrcAuth=atyponcel&amp;SrcA